<title>USA: Macerich stake held by Netherlands company.</title>
<headline>Macerich stake held by Netherlands company.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stichting Pensioenfonds ABP said Thursday it holds a six percent stake in Macerich Co or 1,194,400 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Stichting said its latest transactions include the purchase of 212,500 common shares bought on Oct 31 for $21.75 per share.</p>
<p>The common stock was bought for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
<p>Stichting is an entity established under the laws of the Kingdom of Netherlands whose principal business is investing funds held on behalf of the public sector employees of the Kingdom.</p>
</text>
